---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Beth Rydym yn ei Wneud" title_en="What We Do">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Beth Rydym yn ei Wneud</span><span lang="en">What We Do</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo; <a href="/the-council/"><span lang="cy">Y Cyngor</span><span lang="en">The Council</span></a> &rsaquo; <span lang="cy">Beth Rydym yn ei Wneud</span><span lang="en">What We Do</span></div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content">
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Beth Rydym yn ei Wneud</span><span lang="en">What We Do</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Fel cyngor cymuned, mae gennym ystod o bwerau a chyfrifoldebau i gefnogi ein cymuned leol.</p>
    <p lang="en">As a community council, we have a range of powers and responsibilities to support our local community.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Llais y Gymuned</span><span lang="en">Community Voice</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Rydym yn cynrychioli barn trigolion lleol i Gyngor Bwrdeistref Sirol Conwy a chyrff cyhoeddus eraill.</p>
    <p lang="en">We represent the views of local residents to Conwy County Borough Council and other public bodies.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Cynllunio</span><span lang="en">Planning</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Rydym yn ymgynghori ar geisiadau cynllunio lleol ac yn ymateb i gynlluniau datblygu.</p>
    <p lang="en">We are consulted on local planning applications and respond to development plans.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Grantiau a Rhoddion</span><span lang="en">Grants &amp; Donations</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Rydym yn darparu cyllid i grwpiau a sefydliadau lleol sy'n gwasanaethu'r gymuned.</p>
    <p lang="en">We provide funding to local groups and organisations serving the community.</p>
    <p><a href="/the-council/grants/"><span lang="cy">Mwy am Grantiau →</span><span lang="en">More about Grants →</span></a></p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Yr Amgylchedd Lleol</span><span lang="en">Local Environment</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Rydym yn gweithio i gynnal a gwella'r amgylchedd lleol, gan gynnwys mannau gwyrdd a bioamrywiaeth.</p>
    <p lang="en">We work to maintain and improve the local environment, including green spaces and biodiversity.</p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
